{
  "_comment": [
    "The connector catalog: what `exakit connect` can search and offer.",
    "",
    "  tier    GA, every connector: a rollout label, not an upstream",
    "          certification. Kept for exakit source catalog, its --json and the plan.",
    "  status  candidate = defined and unit-tested, not yet qualified end to end",
    "          against a real source; kit-tested = qualified; gated = defined but",
    "          blocked by a named release gate (see `gate`).",
  "  caveat  said in the plan's warnings: what a candidate has not been run",
  "          against yet (no connector has one today).",
    "  aliases what a search also matches; ambiguous input lists the choices.",
    "  summary what a source of this kind becomes, for the exakit connect menu.",
    "",
    "A connector's inputs, artifacts and SQL live in connectors/<id>/; the",
    "deployment recipe it shares with others in profiles/<profile>/."
  ],
